{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"aac801ccbf47c13b","type":"text","text":"He is a beggar.","x":-1380,"y":-260,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5a16d28ca9a0e650","type":"text","text":"Comfortable. Safe. Trending up. ","x":-1700,"y":-260,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f94f5e70003a16d1","type":"text","text":"He has everything he wants.","x":-1700,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a089768969bfc643","type":"text","text":"He is the king of Meroun.","x":-1700,"y":100,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7e43e90cd02b5f21","type":"text","text":"He is nothing, and a nobody. A commoner.","x":-1700,"y":-20,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b1923dcc0f4a6d2a","type":"text","text":"Dan is in a good spot, good enough for most people. He is the adopted (unofficial) son of a childless minister. (Minister Ama)\n\n\nThis isn’t enough. He isn’t necessarily ambitious, but he wants to be nobility to deserve and marry the woman he’s seeing (a princess of sorts)","x":-1380,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":390,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f4851e83961f41a2","type":"text","text":"What point is this in Dan’s life?","x":-1450,"y":-440,"width":250,"height":79},
		{"id":"afd01e1afdb0e3b5","type":"text","text":"How do I best start this?","x":-1380,"y":380,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e196624f1fe033ea","x":-1380,"y":500,"width":250,"height":100,"type":"text","text":""}
	],
